{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_05_end",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_05",
  "title": "危險交易",
  "storyCode": "MB-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4f161b18f31075c6e41ed0af670d6dd591c4b425c881b72882bfd557a14277c9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我究竟該怎麼做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼事嗎，長官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，羅賓小姐，我一直想見你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想必你現在正在猶豫究竟是要繼續自己的刺殺，還是協助安東尼的越獄吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的名字是傑斯頓，羅賓小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別緊張，我和你一樣，是接受委託潛入監獄刺殺安東尼的殺手之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我恰好偶然聽到了安東尼先生對你發出的越獄邀請......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_Morgue"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安東尼先生，巴頓隊長讓我問你受的傷重不重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "speakerId": "char_264_Mountain",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不重，讓他再等一會，馬上就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，好的，沒有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是那個時候的獄警？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，看來你記起我來了，太好了，我自認還是挺容易被記住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是被你遺忘的話，我會感到悲傷的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，你一直在那聽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，畢竟是我把你們這些昏迷過去的囚犯送過來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然安東尼先生即使在他的“安全屋”裡也壓低了音量，不過對於我這樣的有心人來說，還是非常容易聽到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是來向你提出交易的，羅賓小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交易？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不說，安東尼先生這一手確實值得稱道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "表面上是向你伸出橄欖枝，其實無論你接或者不接，對他來說都沒有損害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "漂亮，即使是我也忍不住想誇讚他一番。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很可惜，他不瞭解你的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則，他恐怕是要斟酌一番的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的身份？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，而你，羅賓小姐，你也沒有察覺到你和安東尼先生之間，事實上存在的聯繫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你究竟在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅賓小姐，你還記得你父親過去意氣風發之時，曾經任職的公司名稱嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑雲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，黑雲貿易有限公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父親是那裡的總經理，但就在他事業最巔峰的時候，黑雲貿易卻突然倒閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那之後，他無論怎麼努力，事業都沒有起色，於是從此一蹶不振，開始酗酒，直到今天，躺在醫院的病床上等待手術的醫藥費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼你知道是誰讓黑雲貿易倒閉的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，正是西蒙家族，而安東尼先生引以為傲的姓氏，也正是西蒙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，為了表達我的誠意，我來告訴你全貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "簡單來說，在六年前，西蒙家族和海德兄弟在為某一樣東西競爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雙方都想吞併對方，並且雙方的實力也相近，於是明爭暗鬥逐漸升級，終於到了見血的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而最終，是海德兄弟搶先一步，將西蒙家族整個覆滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西蒙家族的族長，史密斯·西蒙危難之際，決定將唯一的兒子安東尼·西蒙送到別的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而，在逃到鑄鐵城後，可憐的小安東尼還是被捕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸運的是，在鑄鐵城所屬的州法律中，對逃犯的審判是在本州進行的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，他沒有被移送回堡壘山城，並在審判之後，他按照本州法律，被關進了這座州立曼斯菲爾德監獄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得不說，我甚至認為老史密斯早就算到了這一點，是故意讓安東尼在鑄鐵城被捕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟實際上，正因安東尼沒有回到遍佈海德兄弟勢力的堡壘山城，他才安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這和我爸爸的事又有什麼關係？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛才說了，西蒙家族當時可是和海德兄弟是競爭關係，即使棋差一招，他們臨死前也是有能力反咬一口的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而他們反咬一口的對象之中，就有你父親的公司——黑雲貿易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時，你的父親是海德兄弟最得力的手下之一，黑雲貿易的業績也十分出色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但就像西蒙家族一夜之間蒸發一般，黑雲貿易在西蒙家族的垂死掙扎之下，也一夜之間消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父親當然想要東山再起，但是他的競爭對手們會給他機會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥倫比亞的商場，有時候比戰場還要血腥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "於是，你的父親在那之後，就再也沒有站起來過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，我必須要承認，安東尼先生想要越獄出去找海德兄弟尋仇是很正常的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你呢，羅賓小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們確實可以假設，如果沒有海德兄弟先消滅西蒙家族，那麼西蒙家族就不至於垂危掙扎讓你父親的黑雲貿易倒閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也可以假設，如果是西蒙家族先一步解決了海德兄弟，那麼以史密斯•西蒙在當年展現出的遠高於海德兄弟的胸懷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他也確實很有可能會以更和平的方式處理海德兄弟手下的那些企業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是一切沒有如果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的結果就是——是西蒙家族導致了你父親的黑雲貿易的覆滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你刺殺的對象，安東尼•西蒙，正是這個家族最後的倖存者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得不能這麼算的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，當然，我不會說這是正義的，羅賓小姐，這絕不正義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果悲劇是可以比較的，那我必須要說，海德兄弟欠安東尼先生的債，比他要欠你的重太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但因此我們難道就該說你的復仇應當後於他的復仇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的痛苦就不如他的痛苦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "痛苦是平等的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想你父親這些年悲慘的遭遇，你有足夠的理由置他於死地，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，讓我們來思考另一件事吧，羅賓小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事更加現實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西蒙家族已經覆滅了，即使安東尼先生能夠越獄，即使他向你許諾報酬，即使他最終真的成功了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他又能給你什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他能給你你急需的醫藥費嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能將你的父親轉移到最先進的病房接受治療嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許老史密斯將他的商業頭腦也遺傳給了他的兒子，但是短時間內，他是做不到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我，能夠給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以好好想想，羅賓小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以好好想想，羅賓小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......雇傭我的人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，正是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我同情你的遭遇，但我瞭解過你的性格，知道你不願意接受施捨，而我也並不喜歡施捨他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我為你準備了這樣一筆交易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......為什麼你要告訴我這些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，我一開始並沒有打算在現在接觸你，只不過安東尼先生這一步棋把我逼了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請容我再感慨一下，在這裡生活下來之後，就連我都差一點被安東尼先生的氣魄折服了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而如果我不告訴你這些，你可能就會被廉價的同情心衝昏頭腦而選擇幫助他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而如果我今天單純欺騙你，是安東尼先生導致了你父親公司的覆滅，你恐怕也會在不遠的未來從他那裡聽說事情的全貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼到時候，我在你心中的形象不就變得疏遠與邪惡了起來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以不妨將你該知道的都告訴你，由你自己來抉擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以將過去的糾葛放在一邊，只考慮這一個簡單的問題——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "傑斯頓",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_137",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是為了可能沒有回報的同情心選擇幫助他，還是為了我所許諾的利益協助我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_Morgue"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜瑪",
      "speakerId": "char_441_lotus",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅賓小姐，你想好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "speakerId": "char_451_robin",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我加入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
